                                                "sense_id": "3215c1f6-d8a5-3bbd-8f20-1b8dc09cacb7",
                                                "text": "To distinctify the seasoning, add grated fresh ginger, finely minced green chili (serrano or jalapeno), or chopped fresh herbs: cilantro, mint, thyme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47ce4d97-6797-4380-919a-2da5b3986639",
                                                "sense_id": "3215c1f6-d8a5-3bbd-8f20-1b8dc09cacb7",
                                                "text": "“We use it in drinks. We use it in desserts. We use it in savory food. It’s in almost everything. Salt, sugar and MSG – I always joke that they’re the Chinese Trinity of seasonings.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c4954e97-e16e-33a7-99b3-71a30607edae",
                                        "entry_id": "836a682d-90a3-3831-a598-daa9321225b8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything added to increase enjoyment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
